WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 5e48c6e3703c0748e81c3ff22a9c0bb7

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, mazoezi yote

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.140
uliyofanya yamekuwa na changamoto moja

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.920
tu ya kutatua. Unaandika msimbo,

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.750
unaendeshwa, na ama unafanya kazi au haufanyi. Lakini

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.250
kuanzia sasa, mambo yatakuwa ya kuvutia

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.160
zaidi kidogo. Kila zoezi litakuja na hali tofauti,

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:22.240
yaani hali ambazo msimbo wako unahitaji

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.210
kuzishughulikia. Utaziona kama vitufe vidogo

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.900
juu kidogo ya matokeo ya kila zoezi. Kila kitufe

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.769
kinahusu hali tofauti. Kazi yako ni

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.150
kuandika msimbo unaofanya kazi kwa hali

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.960
zote, si ile ya kwanza tu. Nirudie

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:42.100
tena. Unaandika msimbo wako mara moja,

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:46.060
lakini msimbo huo huo unaendeshwa kwa kila hali.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.900
Tofauti ni kwamba kila hali inaweza kuwa

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.060
imeandaliwa kwa njia tofauti kidogo, au vitendakazi

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.980
ninavyokupa vinaweza kurejesha vitu tofauti kidogo kutegemea

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.140
hali uliyonayo. Hebu tuangalie

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.400
mfano kutoka kwa zoezi lako linalofuata.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.640
Hapo awali, tayari umehuisha mpira ukiviringika

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.000
kwenye mchezo wa gofu. Lakini sasa, unahitaji

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.070
kubadilisha umbali ambao mpira unaviringika kutegemea

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:15.220
thamani inayorejeshwa ya kitendakazi kiitwacho getShotLength,

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.280
ambacho kitakuambia

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.220
mchezaji wa gofu amegonga mpira mbali gani. Fikiria

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:21.800
mchezaji amebidi avute

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:25.040
kidole kwenye simu yake kueleza mbali gani amegonga mpira.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.640
Matokeo yanayokufikia

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:30.280
huja kupitia kitendakazi hiki. Kwa hivyo katika hali moja,

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:34.780
unaweza kutumia kitendakazi getShotLength, na kitarejesha 23,

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:38.930
mvuto mdogo. Katika hali nyingine, kinarejesha 70,

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:42.860
mvuto mrefu. Katika nyingine tena, kinarejesha 45.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:46.980
Msimbo wako unahitaji kuviringisha mpira

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:50.300
umbali unaofaa kwa kila hali kwa

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.900
programu moja tu, seti moja ya msimbo. Utahitaji

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:57.420
kutumia kitendakazi getShotLength kuona

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:00.600
pigo lilifikia mbali gani, kisha uviringishe hadi

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:05.300
mahali hapo. Hali hizi huhakikisha msimbo wako unafanya kazi

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:08.150
vizuri kweli kweli. Ni rahisi kabisa kuandika msimbo

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:11.820
unaofanya kazi katika hali moja maalum. Ni vigumu zaidi,

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.620
na ni jambo lenye thamani zaidi, kuandika msimbo unaofanya kazi

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:18.920
katika hali nyingi tofauti. Unapotatua

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.570
mazoezi haya, au mazoezi ya baadaye,

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.900
anza na hali ya kwanza. Fanya hiyo ifanye kazi.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:27.269
Kisha nenda kwenye hali inayofuata

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.820
na uifanye ifanye kazi. Msimbo wako unaposhindwa

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.580
kwenye hali tofauti, fikiri kuhusu kinachotofautiana

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.140
na jinsi msimbo wako unahitaji kubadilika. Bahati

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:38.000
njema, na tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni.
